  "proofLimits": [
    "Trusted authored tool-workflow data only. No tool, queue, tracing, model or authorization runtime is started. Components do not run a task clock; authored consumer callbacks use fixed 1500ms timers solely to exercise asynchronous feedback.",
    "First ten cases use real official-SDK nested frames; last two use direct docs consumers to isolate selected-member and task revision fences from iframe remounts.",
    "Raw region DOM records current native control values, JSON disclosures, reported progress, child SECTION busy/alerts and lifetime callback counters. Producer alerts remain distinct from the exact consumer-callback error.",
    "Host editor payloads describe invocation data; local controlled selections and filters do not rewrite that editor. Intents carry identity/status/attempt only, never JSON result or trace values.",
    "Pinned SDK console classification is fatal on any unclassified send. No tools/context/message request, download, cookie or browser permission is allowed. Every ordinary request must be owned-origin GET and completely acknowledged.",
    "Chromium narrow touch is emulation, not physical-device or exhaustive accessibility/untrusted-HTML proof. Browser HTTP completion is not raw socket EOF or every-asset integrity; process teardown belongs to the supervisor."
